# 开发直连

# Google Open Source Insights package metadata and dependency graphs used by Tirith.
# https://docs.deps.dev/api/v3/
# Repeated valid API responses were stable directly; this is not a telemetry endpoint.
DOMAIN,api.deps.dev

# Simple Icons SVG CDN; actual icon transfers were stable directly.
# https://github.com/LitoMore/simple-icons-cdn
DOMAIN,cdn.simpleicons.org

# Parallel's hosted Search MCP: web search and page-content extraction.
# https://docs.parallel.ai/integrations/mcp/search-mcp
# Valid MCP initialization, tool listing and repeated web_fetch calls were stable
# directly, with latency comparable to the US proxy and below the Japan proxy.
DOMAIN,search.parallel.ai

# Macrocosmos developer documentation and IOTA training platform website
# https://github.com/macrocosm-os/iota
DOMAIN,docs.macrocosmos.ai
DOMAIN,iota.macrocosmos.ai

# Astral uv installer and release downloads
# https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/
DOMAIN,astral.sh
DOMAIN,releases.astral.sh

# Desearch public website
DOMAIN,www.desearch.ai
DOMAIN,www\.desearch.ai

